# Claude Code local state: worktrees created for isolated plan execution
# (each is its own git worktree with its own .git pointer — must never be
# committed into the parent repo, see superpowers:using-git-worktrees) and
# machine-local permission settings.
.claude/

# Local holding area for the flat configuration.nix/disko.nix/flake.nix/
# home.nix files removed in this commit — kept on disk as a safety net
# during the modular-restructure transition (system-plan.md §3), not meant
# to be tracked (their removal is the actual, deliberate, committed state).
.trash/

# nixos-rebuild build-vm / nix build -o result symlinks and the qcow2 disk
# images they produce (see docs/superpowers/plans/
# 2026-08-08-disk-boot-foundation.md, Task 3, Step 3-4: manual VM runs for
# hibernate verification are throwaway build byproducts, never committed).
result
result-*
*.qcow2
